; RT50 / PT50 (#744). Expectations never obtained by running Tecnigrafo.
; solid-space tests/corpus/casi/geom2d/ellipse-nearest-asse-fuori-dominio.json,
; ellisse-diagnosi-centro-oltre-dominio.json and ellisse-diagnosi-parametro-oltre-dominio.json
; at fc8cae3da8a737510d6b61075b03ea3272228576; PT50.2 translates refusal to infinity/none/false.
Axis = ELLIPSE center=0,0 major-axis=1125899906842625,0 ratio=0.5
Center = ELLIPSE center=1125899906842625,0 major-axis=10,0 ratio=0.5
Parameter = ELLIPSE center=0,0 major-axis=10,0 ratio=0.5 start=0 end=100000000
? distance Axis 0,0 -> inf
? closest Axis 0,0 -> none
? crosses Axis -1,-1 1,1 -> no
? distance Center 0,0 -> inf
? closest Center 0,0 -> none
? crosses Center -1,-1 1,1 -> no
? distance Parameter 0,0 -> inf
? closest Parameter 0,0 -> none
? crosses Parameter -1,-1 1,1 -> no
; ellisse-regola-arc-ridotta-a-un-punto.json: 19080*pi/180 is exactly
; 0x1.4d02421c87558p+8 in binary64. Kernel degenerateCurve; PT50 uses start (10,0).
; cambia con #744
Point = ELLIPSE center=0,0 major-axis=10,0 ratio=0.5 start=0 end=19080
? distance Point 13,4 -> 5
? closest Point 13,4 -> 10,0
? crosses Point 9,-1 11,1 -> yes
? crosses Point -11,-1 -9,1 -> no
? pick 10.1,0 tolerance=0.5 -> Point
? crossing 9,-1 11,1 -> Point
